{"name":"Genericana","title":"Genericana","revision":236618,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Genericana","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Genericana is a visual design aesthetic from the 1980s to the early 2010s that is characterized by old 1920s–1950s American sign-painting fonts, label packaging, and rustic industrial elements to create a fake sense of premium quality and heritage. It gained popularity among the hipster trend during the Great Recession."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visuals"},{"kind":"list","text":"Raw Materials: Rusted steel, exposed brick, reclaimed wood, Edison bulbs."},{"kind":"list","text":"Skeuomorphism: Using old icons and analog textures (like ribbons or stamps) in physical and digital branding to feel authentic."},{"kind":"list","text":"Old-School Packaging: Re-creations of badges, mid-century labels, and crests."},{"kind":"list","text":"Vintage Typography: Bold serif lettering, sign-painting fonts, and chalkboards."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Media"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Brands"},{"kind":"list","text":"Shinola"},{"kind":"list","text":"Field Notes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Filson"},{"kind":"list","text":"Madre Mezcal"},{"kind":"list","text":"Coca-Cola"},{"kind":"list","text":"Prairie Organic Spirits"},{"kind":"list","text":"Dollar Shave Club"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pilgrim's Pomade"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Music Artists / Bands"},{"kind":"list","text":"Amy Winehouse"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ben Miller"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Devil Makes Three"},{"kind":"list","text":"John Mayer"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sufjan Stevens"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bright Eyes"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Moldy Peaches"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tally Hall"},{"kind":"list","text":"Of Monsters and Men"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Literature"},{"kind":"list","text":"1984 (George Orwell)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Men of Letters & People of Substance (Roberto De Vicq De Cumptich with a Preface by Francine Prose)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Expeditions (Karl Iagnemma)"},{"kind":"list","text":"If We Were Villains (M.I. Rio)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Phantom of The Opera (Gaston Leroux)"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/6/66/Screenshot_20260817-153841.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260817073925","caption":"Screenshot 20260817-153841","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Screenshot_20260817-153841.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0418-1.webp","localAvailable":true},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/8/8f/Original_446746035756190bf3a4e5039d4c2b99.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20260526041841","caption":"Genericana · Visual reference 02","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Original_446746035756190bf3a4e5039d4c2b99.png","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0418-2.webp","localAvailable":true}]}